      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": false,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "We need to decide where to pilot the shift handoff this week. Only the East desk has a staffed backup.",
      "translation": "我们得决定本周在哪个服务台试行交接班。目前只有东区服务台安排了替岗人员。",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S002",
      "order": 2,
      "start": "00:00:10",
      "end": "00:00:24",
      "speaker": "SPK001",
      "speaker_candidates": [],
      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": true,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "Jo, the handoff table in your draft averages both desks together. That hides how long West waits. Could you split the results by desk for the review?",
      "translation": "乔，你草稿里的交接表把两个服务台的数据合起来取了平均值，看不出西区等了多久。能把结果按服务台拆开，供评审时看吗？",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S003",
      "order": 3,
      "start": "00:00:23",
      "end": "00:00:33",
      "speaker": "SPK003",
      "speaker_candidates": [],
      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": true,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "West's backup rota is still blank. Even with separate figures, I object to including West until someone can cover a missed handoff.",
      "translation": "西区的替岗排班表还是空的。即使把数据拆开，在有人能补上漏掉的交接之前，我仍反对把西区纳入试点。",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S004",
      "order": 4,
      "start": "00:00:33",
      "end": "00:00:39",
      "speaker": "SPK002",
      "speaker_candidates": [],
      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": false,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "Yes, I'll send the revised table by Thursday noon.",
      "translation": "好的，我会在周四中午前发出改好的表。",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S005",
      "order": 5,
      "start": "00:00:39",
      "end": "00:00:47",
      "speaker": "SPK003",
      "speaker_candidates": [],
      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": false,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "I'll check West's backup rota with the shift leads and report whether anyone can cover.",
      "translation": "我来跟各班负责人核对西区的替岗排班，再反馈有没有人能替岗。",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S006",
      "order": 6,
      "start": "00:00:47",
      "end": "00:00:53",
      "speaker": "SPK002",
      "speaker_candidates": [],
      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": false,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "We could also start weekend handoffs straight away.",
      "translation": "也可以马上开始试行周末交接。",
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "S007",
      "order": 7,
      "start": "00:00:53",
      "end": "00:01:06",
      "speaker": "SPK001",
      "speaker_candidates": [],
      "speaker_confidence": "high",
      "overlap": false,
      "attribution_note": null,
      "language": "en",
      "original_text": "For this week the weekday pilot at East is approved because the backup is staffed. West stays pending until coverage is confirmed. Let's leave weekends out.",
      "translation": "东区有替岗人员，本周批准在东区的工作日试行。西区要等替岗人选确认后再定。周末先不纳入。",
      "confidence": "high"
